<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the privacy policy for Karinderya Wiki and learn how website data may be handled." kicker="Site policy" relatedLinks={[{ label: 'Terms of Use', href: '/terms/' }, { label: 'Disclaimer', href: '/disclaimer/' }, { label: 'Contact', href: '/contact/' }]}>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 31, 2026</p>
  <h2>Information collected</h2>
  <p>This static first edition does not provide user accounts or a working contact form. Standard hosting logs may record technical information such as IP address, browser type, requested pages, and timestamps for security and reliability.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>Google AdSense and Google Analytics are not enabled by default. The site loads either service only when its public deployment configuration is supplied. If either service is enabled later, it may use cookies or similar technologies to process usage, device, and advertising information as explained in Google's own policies.</p>
  <h2>Future analytics and consent</h2>
  <p>Before Google Analytics, Google AdSense, or another measurement or advertising service is activated, this policy should be updated with the provider, purposes, data retention approach, available user choices, and any consent controls required for the visitor's region.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>Browser controls can limit or remove cookies. If consent controls are introduced, visitors should also be able to review or change applicable choices through those controls.</p>
  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>Pages may link to third-party services. Their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.</p>
  <h2>Policy changes</h2>
  <p>This policy may change as site features are added. The date above will identify the current published version.</p>
  <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
  <p>A public contact channel is still being prepared. No unverified email address or contact identity is published on this site.</p>
</InfoPage>
